{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん\nおかえりなさーい＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はレッスンがなかったので\n学校から直帰しましたー☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいまー＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰ってみると\n長野から「二十世紀」梨が\n届いてたぁーワーイo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早速むいて\n食べました〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みずみずしくて\n美味しい(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/7128869/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふたたび川後のひなさんと＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え〜...乃木どこ観てくださった方が\nたくさんいらしたので...ちょっと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみたて会...懐かしかったのですが...\nそ、それと同時に..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な、なんという..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません。。(((((゜゜;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本的に日奈は自分では変わっていないつもりでいたのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思わず「前髪切れー!!」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしくわ「分けとけー!!」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と叫んでしまいたくなるような...\nお見苦しさでした。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれが....\n芸能界に入る前の13歳の日奈で..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの石ころを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャカシャカ...コロコロ...と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんやふぁみりーさんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しずつ磨いて下さってたわけで..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁみりーの皆さんの力をお借りして\n磨いてほしいなぁ....なんて思っている次第であります。。＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん\n他力本願ではなく\n日奈自身も人間的な魅力を\n増せられるように頑張っていきます!!☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今後とも、末長〜く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宜しくお願いします(._.)＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは\nちょこっとお答えー＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.来週、中間試験なんだ。\nひなちまよかったら、上手くいくように\n応援してくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*・ω・){ふぁいとー!!おー!!\nひなももうじきテストだぁー＊\n一緒にがんばろー＼(^o^)／]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ひなちま、俺の受験応援して下さい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*・ω・){学校は縁のあるものです*\n頑張って!!応援してまーす＊]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.今さらですが、ひなちまふぁみりーに入っても良いですか？\nQ.あっ僕もひなちまふぁみりーに入れるんやろか？\nQ.ひなちまふぁみりーに入っても、良いかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*・ω・){もちろんです!!\n宜しくお願いしまーす＊]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.女子のふぁんですが、ひなちま応援しても良いですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*・ω・){嬉しいです!!老若男女だいかんげーい＼(^o^)／]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.推しが違うけど、ひなちまブログにコメントしても良いかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*・ω・){嬉しいです!*ぜひお願いします!!]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.四季で好きな季節は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*・ω・){躍動感のある初夏が好き!!\n秋も大人な雰囲気で好きです☆]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.お台場の写真綺麗だね♪\n本当にひなちまが撮ったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*・ω・){そうですよー＼(^o^)／\nひなちまカメラマンが撮りました*\nちょっと加工しました。えへへっ]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.都民の日って何??祝日なん？\nその休日は、東京でしか発生しない\n休日なんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*・ω・){ひなもふぁみりーさんからのコメントで教えて頂いたのですが、お休みのある都、県は、一都五県だけだそうです。\n学校によってはお休みにならない学校もあるそうですよ♪]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまでー＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/7128869/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日もがんばろー＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな"}],"source":"archive"}